          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 0,
              "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.086,
                0.692,
                0.108
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "14. 核孔复合体是细胞核与细胞质之间的特异性离子交换通道。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 1,
              "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.127,
                0.588,
                0.149
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "15. 细胞周期蛋白可通过依赖泛素的蛋白酶体降解。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.168,
            0.506,
            0.19
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "三、简答题（6分/小题，5小题共30分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.204,
            0.657,
            0.35
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 4,
              "bbox": [
                0.117,
                0.204,
                0.337,
                0.225
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1 简述细胞通讯的方式。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 5,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.236,
                0.463,
                0.257
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2 比较协助扩散与协同运输的异同点。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 6,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.267,
                0.316,
                0.287
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3 简述溶酶体的功能。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 7,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.298,
                0.657,
                0.32
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4 比较 3 种类型细胞的区别（真细菌、古细菌与真核细胞）"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.329,
                0.463,
                0.35
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "5 简述微管在有丝分裂过程中的功能。"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "sub_type": "text"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.366,
            0.495,
            0.387
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "四、论述题（15分/题，4小题共60分）"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.402,
            0.901,
            0.546
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 11,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.402,
                0.901,
                0.454
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "1 如何证明药物 B 可诱导体外培养的癌细胞 A 凋亡？细胞凋亡与细胞坏死有何区别？"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 12,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.464,
                0.331,
                0.484
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "2 试述核小体的结构。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 13,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.495,
                0.767,
                0.516
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "3 试述细胞膜上糖蛋白的来源（包括合成、加工、包装与运输过程）。"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 14,
              "bbox": [
                0.116,
                0.526,
                0.484,
                0.546
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "4 为什么说线粒体是半自主性细胞器？"
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
